       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. FEAT2.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  25ANS PICTURE  99 VALUE ZERO.
       77  25REM PICTURE 99 VALUE ZERO.
       77  25COUNT PICTURE 99 VALUE 3.
       01  GRP SIGN IS LEADING SEPARATE.
           05  TEST-17-C        PIC S9(4).
           05  FILLER           REDEFINES TEST-17-C.
               07  TEST-17-C-SIGN PIC X.
       01  WRK-EDIT-005 PIC 9,9,9,9,9,9,9,9,9,9,9,9,.
       01  ID1-DS-LS-4 PIC S9(4) SIGN LEADING SEPARATE.
       01  ID7-XN-5 PIC X(5).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           DIVIDE  25COUNT INTO 100 GIVING 25ANS REMAINDER 25REM.
           DISPLAY 25ANS " " 25REM.
           MOVE    1234 TO TEST-17-C.
           DISPLAY "[" TEST-17-C-SIGN "][" TEST-17-C "]".
           MOVE    123456789012 TO WRK-EDIT-005.
           DISPLAY "[" WRK-EDIT-005 "]".
           MOVE    +1001 TO ID1-DS-LS-4.
           MOVE    "*****" TO ID7-XN-5.
           STRING ID1-DS-LS-4 DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO ID7-XN-5.
           DISPLAY "[" ID7-XN-5 "]".
           STOP RUN.
